==English==
{{wikipedia}}
{{wikispecies|Ebolavirus}}
===Etymology===
Named after the [[Ebola]] River.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Ebola]] [[virus]]|-}} 

# {{context|virology|lang=en}} Any extremely contagious [[filovirus]] infection of African origin that causes [[Ebola fever]], spread through contact with bodily fluids or secretions of infected persons and by airborne particles, caused by the viruses in genus ''[[Ebolavirus]]''.

